{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021a.q31.material.recovered", "text": "李老师为《美丽的蓝印花布》单元课教学准备中，创设的“情境”是：江苏某地地处美丽富饶的长江三角洲冲积平原，气候温宜，山清水秀。在千百年的历史中，当地人民创造并发展了丰富多彩、名扬四方的民间工艺，蓝印花布是其中最具代表性的民间工艺品之一。为此，当地准备进行一场“传统工艺发布会”以推介蓝印花布。根据上述情境、李老师设计了两个“问题”：蓝印花布是怎么做出来的？有哪些代表性的手工艺人？", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "cb1e4e258b79ae987a014fec6ba83143bf87c4bba0f41d7e45c9d9ddc79cd0a4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2377, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2566, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "cb1e4e258b79ae987a014fec6ba83143bf87c4bba0f41d7e45c9d9ddc79cd0a4"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021a.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k05", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k06", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k09"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r013", "ntce.outline.414.r020", "ntce.outline.414.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021a.q31"], "word_count": 189, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "cb1e4e258b79ae987a014fec6ba83143bf87c4bba0f41d7e45c9d9ddc79cd0a4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2377, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2566, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "s