{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021a.q32.material.recovered", "text": "王老师在高一素描人物基本结构练习时，发现一位学生方法特殊。他不是按照王老师所要求的以写实性素描进行描绘，而是坚持表现自我主观感受，画面产生了“另类”效果。对此，王老师让该学生在全班同学面前阐述这样画的理由，并介绍自己的体会。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "cb1e4e258b79ae987a014fec6ba83143bf87c4bba0f41d7e45c9d9ddc79cd0a4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2602, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2714, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "cb1e4e258b79ae987a014fec6ba83143bf87c4bba0f41d7e45c9d9ddc79cd0a4"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021a.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r013", "ntce.outline.414.r020", "ntce.outline.414.r023", "ntce.outline.414.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2021a.q32"], "word_count": 112, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "cb1e4e258b79ae987a014fec6ba83143bf87c4bba0f41d7e45c9d9ddc79cd0a4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2602, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2714, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "cb1e4e258b7